in pvp\n\nGot 9 kills in a pvp match as a vanguard and it didn't count it towards the 9 kills 9 rounds\n\nSomehow got downed mid execution right before finished a hard strategem \n\nlag issues in pvp made me lose kills \n\nIt's also hard to find the game fun when you've got 2 hellbrutes along with 5 terminators on you\n\nCan't parry while reviving a teammate \n\n\n\nLove and hate it", "timestamp_created": 1732316504, "timestamp_updated": 1782287394, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.517241418361663818", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1732317995, "developer_response": "Hello, brother Mango! \n\nThanks for reaching out. Please accept our apologies for the issue you faced while playing. \n\nCould you please provide us with a bit of more details on your experience with this game function?\n\nPlease create a ticket attaching any screen recording where we can see the issue and your specs by reaching to us directly at the following link: https://support.focus-entmt.com/\n\nThe Emperor Protects!", "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179600865", "author": {"steamid": "76561198061649067", "personaname": "Primarch", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198061649067/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 2911, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 543, "last_played": 1787826124, "avatar": "5fee30fb8d6099e6337b376c15cd2b96196efd00"}, "language": "english", "review": "one of 40k's best games thus far", "timestamp_created": 1732313442, "timestamp_updated": 1732313442, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_acces