, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 439, "last_played": 1739509738, "avatar": "8dc62b81b3175aa2c36357a658683e339b03a75f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Old school gears of war feel, amazing set pieces, tight combat, and just all around Bad @ss", "timestamp_created": 1732305672, "timestamp_updated": 1732305672, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179593459", "author": {"steamid": "76561198029153582", "personaname": "terreus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198029153582/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 924, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 825, "last_played": 1772656999, "avatar": "df03abfb805b6e66a6210a70df8a2576c51d1100"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the best games available in the Warhammer 40k universe. \r\nApart from that: nice story! And going into battle together and side by side with the big tanks and cybots: fantastic!\r\nGameplay: after the main campaign, I still struggle to master the controls and the switch between the weapons. When it comes to fighting, I actually like Darktide more.", "timestamp_created": 1732305410, "timestamp_updated": 1732305410, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179593236", "author": {"steamid": "76561199715451377", "personaname": "johnjacobjingle", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199715451377/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2772, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 308, "last_played": 1785819897, "avatar": "67778066d48ac42122bba289ba37b1524e65695a"}, "language": "english", "review": "its really great", "timestamp_created": 1732305169, "timestamp_updated": 1732305169, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179592772", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042411233", "personaname": "8934 \"Galaar\"", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/8934_galaar/", "num_games_owned": 390, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 41604, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 248, "playtime_at_review": 9671, "last_played": 1788999688, "avatar": "480a63c2aae132676e415905267373d27860c1e0"}, "language": "english", "review": "TLDR: BROTHAAA!!! 9/10!!!\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: I haven't touched the PVP scene AT ALL. PVP is almost never a driving point to my enjoyment (or lack thereof) of a game so take that as it is.\r\n\r\nWarhammer 40,000: Space Marine 2 (SM2) is probably the most fun I've had in a game in a while, even to an extent eclipsing the fun I had in Halo: Infinite. The Campaign was short but felt long because of how it was spaced, the PVE scene is engaging and challenging, and the graphical/sound design is perfect for the setting. The only reason why it isn't a 10/10 from me is I have to knock about 0.5 for part of the story, and 0.5 for part of the PVE, which I will get to.\r\n\r\nThe Story: It delivers exactly what it needs, a capstone from the events of SM1 without closing the door on future story expansions or even a 3rd game. The 0.5 I subtract is because one of the recurring themes (avoiding spoilers here) is dragged out to a point of near obscenity, but is resolved well in the end. There's enough story for it to be called a campaign, and the \"slice of life\" stuff going on on the ship that make the universe feel lived-in was the cherry on top. And being able to share it with my friends with the Co-Op is just what I could've wanted.\r\n\r\nThe PVE: I play the heck out of the PVE. I've played it to the point of completing all the Lethal difficulty missions for that sweet helmet. The only reason I knock 0.5 off for the PVE, is because I don't like some of the limitations on current customization. With Deathwatch cosmetics available so readily, I don't understand why more chapter markings weren't already set up for the right shoulder, and I wish that the shoulder plate cosmetics weren't so... busy, overall. Last nit-pick, is that while I understand the game is 100% an Ultramarines 2nd Company perspective, I wish to the Throne I could use different banners on the Bulwark. A Blood Raven may've \"tactically borrowed\" the 2nd Company flag, but not a Black Templar.\r\n\r\nNitpicks aside....\r\n\r\nI love this game, it's a solid story with good PVE. I've even found myself grumbling about the \"randos\" (random players I find in quickplay) less than I have in ANY other game. It's probably going to join a few other select games in the \"never to be uninstalled\" category of my library.", "timestamp_created": 1732304708, "timestamp_updated": 1732304708, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179592135", "author": {"steamid": "76561198364603291", "personaname": "DeadOne", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198364603291/", "num_games_owned": 73, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 2139, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 264, "last_played": 1781901064, "avatar": "236caf4df5cd405840c6f01ca849e8bd345fb90e"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game", "timestamp_created": 1732304026, "timestamp_updated": 1732304026, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179590984", "author": {"steamid": "76561199134372652", "personaname": "Revergence", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199134372652/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 319, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 319, "last_played": 1727755877, "avatar": "236caf4df5cd405840c6f01ca849e8bd345fb90e"}, "language": "english", "review": "This was my first introduction to Warhammer, and I have to say I was not at all impressed. The game play is VERY repetitive, characters are boring and uninteresting, no one has any personality. As soon as I landed in the first campaign mission, I was immediately uninterested. There's nothing captivating here. It wants to be Gears of war, but it's not. There are only 3-4 maps in PVP and you get tired of it after the first couple of hours. Huge letdown, maybe if you are a big Warhammer fan you'll like it, but for someone that doesn't know anything about Warhammer this is an immediate pass. Not even worth $30, would return if I could. Wasted my money.", "timestamp_created": 1732302858, "timestamp_updated": 1732302858, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.495537221431732178", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1732318800, "developer_response": "Thank you for the valuable feedback you're providing.\n \nWe're listening to our battle brothers' comments. So, we can assure you that Emperor's finest teams are working to improve the game, like rebalancing weapons, difficulty on PVP and PVE, and some extra things to make it more interesting to provide the best experience for all players.\n \nYour continued patience and cooperation are more than appreciated. The Emperor is pleased to see one of his marines so eager to help the Imperium this way.\n\nThe Emperor Protects!", "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179590334", "author": {"steamid": "76561198123783183", "personaname": "Dralax", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198123783183/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 3520, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1866, "last_played": 1754092256, "avatar": "d4d03481a114a2b5bb70ca37b6b53a41a900bfdf"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great Game", "timestamp_created": 1732302199, "timestamp_updated": 1732302199, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179588130", "author": {"steamid": "76561197960362074", "personaname": "Sgt.Knumskull", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/sgtknumskull/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 46, "playtime_forever": 475, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 417, "last_played": 1754500695, "avatar": "1a3ac27b8c2aa05a496003a93d1ec1f4052c8bcb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Crash on opening cut scene. Good starter. Had to google some work-arounds. Means it is a well known problem that remains unfixed. Classy.\n\nNO MANUAL SAVING! YOU ARE FORCED TO USE THEIR CHECKPOINT SYSTEM!\nCan't reload earlier checkpoints, replay parts, re-watch a cut-scene etc.\nInexplicably long loading times.\nCompiling shaders every start.\nAudio delayed in every cut-scene.\n\"Server connections lost\" issues in a single-player game.\nTechnical aspect: failure.\n\nGraphics/animations feel outdated.\nThe combat system is super flat aka simplistic.\nThe missions are hyper boring: you follow a tunnel to a checkpoint, some dialogue, then a defend area or survive n-minutes combat scene, walk along the corridor to the next part, that is of exactly the same structure as the one you just finished.\nContent aspect: failure.\n\nFor a company that made \"World War Z\" this is ultra lame. It is essentially the same game just with an elaborate re-skin and it manages to be more boring and predictable than the thing it is copied from.\nIf you are not into multi player matches like me, you can easily avoid this masterpiece without missing anything.", "timestamp_created": 1732299976, "timestamp_updated": 1732826486, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1732319535, "developer_response": "Thank you for sharing your experience with the Imperium, Sgt.Knumskull.\n \nWe understand how frustrating it can be to deal with these issues by trying to play. It's unfortunate that this impacted your ability to properly enjoy Space Marines 2.\n \nWe will escalate your input and feedback to our development team. If any of those issues happens again, please do not hesitate in reach us at:\n\nhttps://support.focus-entmt.com/\n \nBeing part of our community and letting us know about this situation is more than appreciated. We deeply hope you find happiness in your gaming experiences and look forward to your continued support!", "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179585131", "author": {"steamid": "76561198176548858", "personaname": "pjayepicwill", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198176548858/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 9547, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6852, "last_played": 1736064926, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "english", "review": "Nice add on to the first games story, Fun and bloody, as it should be. hoping and waiting for added content", "timestamp_created": 1732296870, "timestamp_updated": 1732296870, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179584845", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018726085", "personaname": "KMF", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198018726085/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 688, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 688, "last_played": 1746232609, "avatar": "15f87538aaa2f535b2e83c897bf5b3b3e7b22da5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Campaign is short (11h), but good", "timestamp_created": 1732296579, "timestamp_updated": 1746232667, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1732318355, "developer_response": "Thank you for sharing your experience with the Imperium, KMF.\n\nWe understand how frustrating it can be to deal with these crashing issues. It's unfortunate that this impacted your ability to enjoy Space Marines 2.\n\nWe will escalate your review to our development team. If you need further assistance, please reach us at:\n\nhttps://support.focus-entmt.com/\n\nThank you for being part of our community and for letting us know about this situation. We hope you find happiness in your gaming experiences and look forward to your continued support!", "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179583772", "author": {"steamid": "76561198104733481", "personaname": "Yui907", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Yui907/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 33, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 33, "last_played": 1726183054, "avatar": "a9678967fc5b1d39b0a13df809829bee99a86e11"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game is poorly optimised for mouse and keyboard.", "timestamp_created": 1732295442, "timestamp_updated": 1732295442, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.491803258657455444", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "timestamp_dev_responded": 1732304896, "developer_response": "Hello Yui907,\n\nI'm sorry to read you're having issues with the game. In order to solve this, please feel free to reach out to our support channels using the next link https://support.focus-entmt.com/\n\nRegards,\nNumitor\nFocus Support Team", "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179580746", "author": {"steamid": "76561198050807046", "personaname": "Valtanus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/daviderido/", "num_games_owned": 30, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 7433, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5152, "last_played": 1781818312, "avatar": "bdc407c1343564b90c8062cfd6cc0dfa328ad2fa"}, "language": "english", "review": "Bellissimo gioco, modalità storia breve ma intensa e gloriosa.\r\nIl multigiocatore PVE è fantastico, un pò monotono avendo poche mappe, ma col tempo penso migliorerà soltanto mano a mano che aggiungono nuove mappe..\r\nNiente PAY TO WIN che adoro, si deve giocare per sbloccare tutto.\r\n\r\nFantastico uno dei giochi piu divertenti e epici degli ultimi anni.", "timestamp_created": 1732292581, "timestamp_updated": 1732292581, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179580014", "author": {"steamid": "76561198384658744", "personaname": "Ls", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198384658744/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 1479, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 814, "last_played": 1732478282, "avatar": "4c76064be169987500e4c7e228aabe3e33e1df47"}, "language": "english", "review": "good game", "timestamp_created": 1732291895, "timestamp_updated": 1732291895, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179578747", "author": {"steamid": "76561199191725258", "personaname": "circle-k sandwich-モスティ", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199191725258/", "num_games_owned": 105, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 3990, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3833, "last_played": 1787237662, "avatar": "4ac0cc4d6f536c15d671146d187